WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.240
Hey everybody, my name is Barry.

00:03.240 --> 00:07.520
I run an agency with seven employees.

00:07.520 --> 00:11.920
Since I started working with Javier and Johnny,

00:11.920 --> 00:16.920
my agency has scaled from doing 20 deals a week

00:19.240 --> 00:21.440
to 50 deals a week.

00:21.440 --> 00:24.240
And not only that, but now I do not have the burden

00:24.240 --> 00:25.960
of running my own Facebook ads,

00:25.960 --> 00:28.520
although I am capable of doing it.

00:28.520 --> 00:32.840
Before I was much more reactive than I was proactive.

00:32.840 --> 00:36.600
Now I have quantity and I have quality.

00:36.600 --> 00:39.540
And I don't have to worry about the quality dropping.

00:39.540 --> 00:41.900
I don't have to worry about the quantity.

00:41.900 --> 00:46.320
Everything is absolutely running better than it ever has.

00:46.320 --> 00:48.240
I can't recommend them enough.

00:48.240 --> 00:49.840
If anybody wants to reach out to me

00:49.840 --> 00:52.260
and hear more about my testimonial,

00:52.260 --> 00:54.080
I'd be happy to speak with you.

00:54.080 --> 00:54.920
Thank you.

